Subject: [PATCH 2/2] dispatch nms_rotated_cpu on scalar_type(), not type()

`AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES(dets.type(), ...)` passes a DeprecatedTypeProperties,
which torch 2.x's dispatch macro no longer accepts, so the in-place build of the
vendored ops (`python setup.py build_ext --inplace`) stops at:

    nms_rotated.cpp:62: cannot convert 'const at::DeprecatedTypeProperties' to 'c10::ScalarType'

The env needs torch 2.7.1+cu128 for Blackwell (sm_120) kernels. Same op, same
dispatch; only the argument's type changes.

---
diff --git a/mmcv/ops/csrc/pytorch/cpu/nms_rotated.cpp b/mmcv/ops/csrc/pytorch/cpu/nms_rotated.cpp
index 223ee1a..d2774c8 100644
--- a/mmcv/ops/csrc/pytorch/cpu/nms_rotated.cpp
+++ b/mmcv/ops/csrc/pytorch/cpu/nms_rotated.cpp
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@ Tensor nms_rotated_cpu_kernel(const Tensor dets, const Tensor scores,
 Tensor nms_rotated_cpu(const Tensor dets, const Tensor scores,
                        const float iou_threshold) {
   auto result = at::empty({0}, dets.options());
-  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES(dets.type(), "nms_rotated", [&] {
+  AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES(dets.scalar_type(), "nms_rotated", [&] {
     result = nms_rotated_cpu_kernel<scalar_t>(dets, scores, iou_threshold);
   });
   return result;
